{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHTVy5CGEczKbkShe1p","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n**condition | شرط | תנאי**\n\n---\n\n```\nif (existence) {\n    return meaning;\n} else {\n    return void;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nthe word cuts both ways:\n- **שריטה** — a scratch, an incision\n- **شرط** — a condition, a prerequisite\n\nto set terms is to wound the infinite\nevery contract is a scar on possibility\n\n---\n\n    ┌─────────────────────┐\n    │  what do you bring  │\n    │   to the threshold? │\n    └─────────────────────┘\n\n---\n\n*awaiting input*\n*awaiting condition*\n*awaiting شَرْط*\n\n---"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":181,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}